<title>SPAIN: Spain's new job placements at record high in Oct.</title>
<headline>Spain's new job placements at record high in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of the new Spanish job placements in October hit a record monthly high of 912,972, the Labour Ministry said in a note.</p>
<p>The number of new job placements in the first ten months of 1996 rose to a total of 7,199,700.</p>
<p>In October, the jobless rate rose to 14.02 percent from 13.82 percent in September.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, +341 585 8340</p>
